{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001154","compactId":"SO_0001154","id":"SO:0001154","label":"beta_turn_type_six_b","definition":{"text":"A motif of four consecutive peptide residues, of which the i+2 residue is proline, and that may contain one H-bond, which, if present, is between the main-chain CO of the first residue and the main-chain NH of the fourth and is characterized by the dihedral angles: Residue(i+1): phi ~ -120 degrees, psi ~ 120 degrees. Residue(i+2): phi ~ -60 degrees, psi ~ 0 degrees.","xrefs":["PMID:2371257","SO:cb"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"beta turn type six b"},{"scope":"exact","value":"type VIb beta turn"},{"scope":"exact","value":"type VIb turn"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":["biosapiens"],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0001154/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0001150"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001150","SO:0001133","SO:0001128","SO:0001078","SO:0001070","SO:0000839","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001150"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001150","id":"SO:0001150","label":"beta_turn_type_six"}],"children":[],"related":[]}}